可以精简成一个纯操作版，重点标明**当前分支**、**同步点**和**提交信息**。

# README.sync

## 1. Branches

```text
upstream/crash.git
       ↓
     master
       ↓
      aml
       ↓
Amlogic modifications
```

* `master`：同步 `crash-utility/crash.git` 的 upstream master
* `aml`：基于 `master`，包含 Amlogic 修改
* `<SYNC_POINT>`：上一次同步的 `master` commit

---

## 2. First-time Setup

### [Any branch] Add upstream remote

```bash
git remote add upstream https://github.com/crash-utility/crash.git
git remote -v
```

Expected:

```text
origin    <your repository>
upstream  https://github.com/crash-utility/crash.git
```

---

## 3. Sync crash.git/master → Local master

### [master] Fetch upstream

```bash
git checkout master
git status

git fetch upstream master
```

Check upstream updates:

```bash
git log --oneline master..upstream/master
```

### [master] Update local master

```bash
git merge --ff-only upstream/master
```

Verify:

```bash
git log --oneline -5
```

---

## 4. Sync master → aml

Assume the previous synchronization point is:

```text
abc1234
Merge master updates since 1234567
```

The new `master` is:

```text
def5678
upstream commit message
```

Therefore, this synchronization contains:

```text
abc1234 → def5678
```

### [Create temp branch] Start from previous sync point

```bash
git checkout -b temp_merge abc1234
```

### [temp_merge] Squash master updates

```bash
git merge --squash master
```

Check changes:

```bash
git status
git diff --stat
```

### [temp_merge] Commit synchronized changes

```bash
git add .
git commit -m "Merge master updates since abc1234"
```

Example:

```text
[ temp_merge 789abcd ] Merge master updates since abc1234
```

---

## 5. Merge Sync Commit into aml

### [aml]

```bash
git checkout aml
git status

git merge temp_merge
```

Example:

```text
abc1234 ── Amlogic changes ── Amlogic changes
   \
    789abcd  Merge master updates since abc1234
                         ↓
                        aml
```

If there are conflicts:

```bash
# Resolve conflicts first

git status
git add <resolved-files>
git commit
```

---

## 6. Delete Temporary Branch

### [aml]

```bash
git branch -D temp_merge
```

---

## 7. Record New Synchronization Point

### [master]

```bash
git checkout master
git rev-parse HEAD
```

Example:

```text
def5678
```

Record:

```text
Previous sync point:
abc1234

New sync point:
def5678
```

The next synchronization starts from:

```bash
git checkout -b temp_merge def5678
```

---

# Complete Example

Assume:

```text
Previous sync point:
abc1234

Current upstream/master:
def5678
```

### [master] Update from crash.git

```bash
git checkout master
git status

git fetch upstream master
git merge --ff-only upstream/master
```

### [temp_merge] Create sync branch

```bash
git checkout -b temp_merge abc1234
git merge --squash master
```

### [temp_merge] Create sync commit

```bash
git add .
git commit -m "Merge master updates since abc1234"
```

Example:

```text
789abcd Merge master updates since abc1234
```

### [aml] Merge synchronized changes

```bash
git checkout aml
git merge temp_merge
```

### [aml] Delete temporary branch

```bash
git branch -D temp_merge
```

### [master] Get new sync point

```bash
git checkout master
git rev-parse HEAD
```

Result:

```text
def5678
```

Next time:

```bash
git checkout -b temp_merge def5678
```

---

